        "Auto: Tone & White Balance — one-click exposure, Whites/Blacks, Highlights/Shadows and colour cast, like Lightroom's Auto.\n\nIt measures the photo and applies ColorLab settings; params_json shows them. Connect params_json to a ColorLab to fine-tune (its sliders add on top) or to Apply ColorLab Preset for other photos. Lower max_wb_shift when warm or cool light is intended."
